record legeos.evidence.card-targets-park-motion-nested-20261004/1 : evidence {
    title "With sessiond running, the probe window's park produced an intermediate frame drawn faded, chrome removed and displaced toward its Home card before it vanished; no warnings, errors or panics in compositor or shell logs. The restore direction was not observed: gtk present() after iconify carries no activation token the compositor accepts, and no pointer was driven on the host desktop."
    state verified
    result pass
    method observation
    observed_at git:2bc8f741f3c21759c3e7c728d9c211868035aa18
    command "nested winit compositor on the Lubuntu X11 host (DISPLAY=:0, socket templaros-x11test) + sessiond + shell from /tmp/legeos-clippy-target; .agent/scratch/nested-x11/minimize_probe.py (GTK window calling iconify) as the parking client; frames captured with ImageMagick import"
    artifact ".agent/scratch/nested-x11/p2pair.png"
    summary """
        With sessiond running, the probe window's park produced an intermediate frame drawn faded, chrome removed and displaced toward its Home card before it vanished; no warnings, errors or panics in compositor or shell logs. The restore direction was not observed: gtk present() after iconify carries no activation token the compositor accepts, and no pointer was driven on the host desktop.
        """
    author "dk"
}

