    summary """
        At fbe44804, the 16 existing garden tests pass. A temporary standalone Rust probe against the current lege-field rlib executes seven assertions documenting current behavior: on a 12x8 empty field, bottom-left 2x2 at (0,6) requesting 4x3 reaches only 4x2; pinned 2x2 at top-left requesting 3x2 grows; pinned with wanted=None stays; forgetting the context (empty ContextView list) leaves its tile; a manually placed same-path 3x3 folder with a new unprotected Trace context shrinks to 2x2; user_span=Some does not prevent Dormant removal; garden A at (0,0) 2x2 growing to 3x2 shifts neighboring garden B from (2,0) to (3,0) through Resize yielding. Probe uses only in-memory FieldDocuments and no live services. Result fail denotes violated usability/invariant expectations, not failing existing tests.
        """
}

