    summary """
        Working tree on top of 137e1e4 (uncommitted). Run 1, fresh with a missing package injected: free-space created p5/p6, bootstrap, step 7 wrote /etc/resolv.conf -> /run/systemd/resolve/stub-resolv.conf into the chroot's tmpfs /run and getent resolved archive.ubuntu.com, stopped at step 9 with 'Recorded install state: bootstrapped' and the rerun command. Run 2: verdict resumable, bootstrap skipped, packages installed, stopped at the NVIDIA step because the set pins 7.0.0-31.31/580.173.02 and the archive had 7.0.0-34/580.178. After switching to the base.toml snapshot: run 3 verdict rebuild (unrecorded mirror), reformatted only p5/p6, bootstrapped from snapshot.ubuntu.com, stopped at the injected package; run 4 resumed through kernel+NVIDIA, flatpak, grub, efibootmgr (Boot0008 created and verified), seeded 7.0.0-31-generic, stopped at doctor build-set-coherent (templar-files not installed); run 5 resumed in 12 s, kept Boot0008, doctor 11 pass 0 fail, state complete, 'autoinstall: DONE'. Run 6: verdict complete, nothing written, one TemplarOS firmware entry. With the state file and known-good removed and @/run/systemd/resolve/stub-resolv.conf added (the laptop's current shape) --inspect says rebuild. The installed disk booted from Boot0008 under SB to a compositor cursor; the greeter UI was not visible under bochs-drm. tests/integration/provision-plan.sh and provision-qemu.sh OK.
        """
}

